/-- For [the specified mathematical inputs](hyp:ε,K,r), [this definition](goal) introduces the corresponding object. -/
def equalWidthMidpoint (ε : ℝ) (K : ℕ) (r : LabelSpace K) : ℝ :=
  ε + ((r.val : ℝ) + 1 / 2) * (1 - 2 * ε) / K

