/-- For [the specified mathematical inputs](hyp:α), [this definition](goal) introduces the corresponding object. -/
def trialCertificate (α : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  (1 - 2 * α) * Real.sqrt (Real.log (1 + (1 - 2 * α) ^ 2)) / 4
